+/*
+ * Lifts. The same level's last puzzle: when the three buttons are
+ * pressed, the stone pillar in the middle of the crossroads sinks level
+ * with the floor; stood on, it lifts the player to the floor above, and a
+ * bridge slides out from it, slowly, to the far side. Nothing said any of
+ * it. Read from the scripts as the rest: a trigger for the player whose
+ * event sends a script mover up past it is a lift, and a door its event
+ * sets off is its bridge. Said as it comes down to the floor, as it
+ * rises, and as the bridge comes out, stops and goes back.
+ */
+#define ETA_MAX_LIFTS 4
